劉波疏又自言亡祖隗；未明言其父為綏。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liubo:p001","text":"波字道則。初為石季龍冠軍將軍王洽參軍，及季龍死，洽與波俱降。穆帝以波為襄城太守，累遷桓沖中軍諮議參軍。大司馬桓溫西征袁真，朝廷空虛，以波為建威將軍、淮南內史，領五千人鎮石頭。壽陽平，除尚書左丞，不拜，轉冠軍將軍、南郡相。時苻堅弟融圍雍州刺史硃序于襄陽，波率眾八千救之，以敵強不敢進，序竟陷沒。波以畏懦免官。後復以波為冠軍將軍，累遷散騎常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":22,"last_line":22,"raw_start":2014,"raw_end":2186,"raw_character_offsets":[2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026,2027,2028,2029,2030,2031,2032,2033,2034,2035,2036,2037,2038,2039,2040,2041,2042,2043,2044,2045,2046,2047,2048,2049,2050,2051,2052,2053,2054,2055,2056,2057,2058,2059,2060,2061,2062,2063,2064,2065,2066,2067,2068,2069,2070,2071,2072,2073,2074,2075,2076,2077,2078,2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133,2134,2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143,2144,2145,2146,2147,2148,2149,2150,2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185],"revision_id":2012453},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liubo:p001:m0000","surface":"波","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"2hn_m25_wu8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liubo:p001:m0007","surface":"石季龍","start":7,"end":10,"person_id":"u61_ylg_6av","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liubo:p001:m0014","surface":"王洽","start":14,"end":16,"person_id":"6p4_8g0_zeb","kind":"person","status":"cont